"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjgpaiu9tmWAxUykq8BHcTXHtsQ3IcHCJcCKB0",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"這裡的停車情況如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_DIFFICULT_TO_FIND"],"停車不方便",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjgpaiu9tmWAxUykq8BHcTXHtsQ3YcHCJsCKAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwjgpaiu9tmWAxUykq8BHcTXHtsQ3IcHCJoCKB4",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_NO_PARKING"],"不提供停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjgpaiu9tmWAxUykq8BHcTXHtsQ3YcHCJ0CKAA"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwjgpaiu9tmWAxUykq8BHcTXHtsQ3IcHCJwCKB8",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjgpaiu9tmWAxUykq8BHcTXHtsQ3YcHCJ8CKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjgpaiu9tmWAxUykq8BHcTXHtsQ3IcHCJ4CKCA",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["老闆人非常好，真的有用心在照料每一位客人，離開前還會詢問我們的感受！🙂\u200d↕️🙂\u200d↕️\n\n拉麵的風味很日式，雞白湯都是老闆精心熬製而成，最重要的是麵團份量很剛好、口感也很佳～～\n\n另外店內的氛圍很棒，走道及用餐空間非常寬敞舒適，唯獨比較可惜的部分是..店內的油煙味會有點重，小小的不舒服！🙏🙏\n\n今日點了兩碗拉麵、一碗叉燒飯：\n❶蒜味雞白湯拉麵 210元（大推）\n喜歡重口味的朋友很建議點這道～\n拉麵上頭會放上一球蒜泥，融合在一起超夠味，最讓我印象深刻的是，他們竟然有放上高麗菜絲，重點不違和、很好吃，意外增添不少口感！推\n\n❷鹽味雞白湯拉麵 210元\n吃過蒜味雞白拉麵，就會覺得這個很清淡！但我認真覺得它適合每個人，尤其想要吃口味不要太重的人，鹽味、醬油都可以選擇！\n「麵量基本都是150公克」，在拉麵界裡，這份量算非常多，雖然不能另外加麵跟續麵，但我覺得是可以接受的🙌🏻🙌🏻\n\n❸炙燒飯 100元（推）\n光看碗的外型就覺得份量也很巨大🤣\n完全超越我對日式叉燒飯的理解，我總感覺老闆是想要讓每個人都吃得飽 哈哈\n總之就是好吃～～推薦",null,[0,87]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7261358169378206706/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklkMDlEVTNkUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7261358169378206706/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklkMDlEVTNkUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7261358169378206706/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTklkMDlEVTNkUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7261358169378206706/customers/reviews/deletere